WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.850
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:09.120 --> 00:09.610
Yamao.

3
00:10.070 --> 00:11.370
Do you even know what you're doing?

4
00:12.280 --> 00:12.820
When the time comes,

5
00:13.360 --> 00:14.480
how will you explain yourself

6
00:14.480 --> 00:15.320
to your master, Danshen?

7
00:15.320 --> 00:16.210
Of course I know

8
00:16.210 --> 00:17.070
what I'm doing.

9
00:17.480 --> 00:18.420
You're the one

10
00:18.960 --> 00:19.810
who refuses to see reason!

11
00:21.600 --> 00:22.490
How dare you!

12
00:22.830 --> 00:23.890
If Danshen knew

13
00:23.890 --> 00:25.140
Qi Fengyin had led you astray

14
00:25.140 --> 00:26.250
and made you the devil's lackey,

15
00:26.670 --> 00:27.740
he'd be devastated.

16
00:28.000 --> 00:29.110
For Danshen's sake,

17
00:29.280 --> 00:30.330
and for everyone in this world,

18
00:30.600 --> 00:32.940
you and Qi Fengyin must die today!

19
01:25.060 --> 01:30.940
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

20
01:32.980 --> 01:38.940
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

21
01:39.980 --> 01:44.220
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

22
01:47.900 --> 01:55.460
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

23
01:55.820 --> 02:02.580
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

24
02:03.820 --> 02:10.460
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

25
02:11.660 --> 02:18.500
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

26
02:20.100 --> 02:26.620
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

27
02:31.380 --> 02:33.180
[Blossom in Darkness]

28
02:33.180 --> 02:35.180
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

29
02:35.180 --> 02:38.180
[Episode 14]

30
02:43.590 --> 02:44.220
Du Zhong.

31
02:45.080 --> 02:46.380
You wanted to become immortal,

32
02:47.280 --> 02:48.890
so you murdered countless people

33
02:49.470 --> 02:51.380
to practice these forbidden arts.

34
02:52.470 --> 02:55.260
I'll destroy everything you've worked for.

35
02:59.470 --> 03:00.060
The blood pool.

36
03:01.240 --> 03:01.730
Du Zhong!

37
03:17.400 --> 03:18.690
Why is Master Du leaving now?

38
03:25.710 --> 03:26.410
I'm fine.

39
03:26.840 --> 03:28.260
You took a direct hit from the Five Great Sects.

40
03:28.710 --> 03:29.780
How can you be fine?

41
03:34.680 --> 03:36.100
I think this protected me.

42
03:36.800 --> 03:37.890
The talisman's been repaired?

43
03:39.430 --> 03:40.450
Du Zhong has it,

44
03:41.000 --> 03:42.060
it's still missing a piece.

45
03:42.680 --> 03:43.260
What a shame.

46
03:43.960 --> 03:44.820
Don't worry about that.

47
03:46.280 --> 03:47.410
Once I reclaim the malice,

48
03:48.310 --> 03:49.260
I can fix

49
03:49.400 --> 03:50.260
that little flaw too.

50
03:50.630 --> 03:51.130
Really?

51
03:57.520 --> 03:58.450
Don't ever do that again.

52
04:09.560 --> 04:11.130
You could've gathered all the malice

53
04:11.280 --> 04:12.260
and left Mount Zhaowu long ago.

54
04:13.310 --> 04:14.500
But because of me, you...

55
04:14.560 --> 04:16.250
Even if the immortal sects reject you,

56
04:17.310 --> 04:18.340
you still won't regret it?

57
04:20.560 --> 04:22.220
Better than mourning you every day.

58
04:22.680 --> 04:23.930
I don't want to live with that guilt forever.

59
04:30.510 --> 04:32.290
I doubt you'd feel guilty forever.

60
04:36.270 --> 04:37.410
Just now, were you worried

61
04:37.830 --> 04:38.980
about the mystical flower

62
04:39.680 --> 04:40.810
or about me?

63
04:49.480 --> 04:50.900
Back in Qingjing Grove,

64
04:51.560 --> 04:53.250
we missed a few clues.

65
04:54.240 --> 04:54.730
What?

66
04:55.160 --> 04:56.540
Yeniang is Hua Changpu.

67
05:00.600 --> 05:01.220
That scar,

68
05:02.070 --> 05:03.140
and the way she walks...

69
05:05.510 --> 05:06.610
I should've known.

70
05:07.040 --> 05:07.930
Let's get to the blood pool first.

71
05:09.160 --> 05:10.250
Right now, Hua Changpu

72
05:10.310 --> 05:11.610
wants nothing but to destroy Du Zhong.

73
05:57.560 --> 05:58.140
Master.

74
06:02.510 --> 06:04.250
Can you give up the Path of Detachment?

75
06:30.480 --> 06:31.580
All these years,

76
06:34.390 --> 06:36.100
why haven't I dreamed of you?

77
07:07.000 --> 07:08.700
A man devoted to the Path of Detachment,

78
07:08.750 --> 07:10.100
the leader of Mount Zhaowu,

79
07:13.750 --> 07:14.980
actually gave in to desire

80
07:15.720 --> 07:17.800
for an ugly old woman

81
07:17.800 --> 07:18.980
like me.

82
07:20.480 --> 07:23.810
You threw away all your cultivation.

83
07:57.480 --> 08:00.810
You really have gone mad chasing power.

84
08:01.160 --> 08:02.850
Your immortal body is broken,

85
08:03.040 --> 08:04.220
and your cultivation is gone.

86
08:04.680 --> 08:05.660
Yet you still think

87
08:06.160 --> 08:08.220
this forbidden blood pool ritual can help you ascend?

88
08:25.240 --> 08:26.580
There's still the Saintess's divine power.

89
08:27.630 --> 08:29.730
It's not too late.

90
08:31.270 --> 08:31.730
Come!

91
08:43.790 --> 08:44.460
Now,

92
08:45.750 --> 08:47.580
it's time to honor our agreement.

93
08:48.000 --> 08:48.610
I want you

94
08:48.790 --> 08:50.340
to pour every bit of your divine power

95
08:50.630 --> 08:52.820
into the life-tracking stone!

96
09:00.750 --> 09:02.580
That's Hua Changpu's life-tracking stone.

97
09:03.440 --> 09:04.820
Why keep the life-tracking stone

98
09:04.870 --> 09:05.530
of someone who's dead?

99
09:09.080 --> 09:10.130
She's not dead.

100
09:12.030 --> 09:13.010
Her life-tracking stone

101
09:13.960 --> 09:14.770
is still glowing.

102
09:18.720 --> 09:19.340
It's just...

103
09:20.600 --> 09:21.940
It's been so long.

104
09:23.440 --> 09:24.700
I've never been able to find

105
09:24.720 --> 09:25.490
her remains.

106
09:28.550 --> 09:29.250
But now...

107
09:30.870 --> 09:32.490
Now I have this pool of blood and flesh,

108
09:33.670 --> 09:35.130
along with the Saintess's power.

109
09:36.030 --> 09:37.300
With enough power,

110
09:37.840 --> 09:38.980
I can create

111
09:39.480 --> 09:40.980
a new body for her.

112
09:41.510 --> 09:43.850
I will bring her back.

113
09:54.360 --> 09:55.250
All these years,

114
09:57.200 --> 09:58.490
day and night,

115
09:59.960 --> 10:01.940
I've suffered over her tragic death.

116
10:04.320 --> 10:06.980
It's driven me mad.

117
10:14.720 --> 10:17.580
I don't care about cultivation or power.

118
10:18.320 --> 10:19.770
I'd give up everything

119
10:20.270 --> 10:21.490
for just one chance

120
10:21.840 --> 10:23.370
to make a different choice.

121
10:24.000 --> 10:25.060
I need Changpu

122
10:25.550 --> 10:27.490
back by my side!

123
10:35.200 --> 10:36.460
You wanted her dead,

124
10:36.840 --> 10:38.180
so she died.

125
10:39.670 --> 10:41.130
Now you want her alive,

126
10:42.000 --> 10:44.340
so she has to come back to life?

127
10:46.910 --> 10:47.940
What gives you the right?

128
10:49.000 --> 10:50.400
Why should someone

129
10:50.400 --> 10:51.700
as selfish as you

130
10:52.120 --> 10:53.130
always get what you want?

131
10:56.270 --> 10:56.730
Stop!

132
11:03.630 --> 11:04.130
Duyao.

133
11:09.720 --> 11:10.580
Anyone who stands in my way

134
11:11.120 --> 11:11.980
will die!

135
11:14.720 --> 11:15.580
Haven't you figured it out?

136
11:16.030 --> 11:17.180
Yeniang is Hua Changpu.

137
11:17.790 --> 11:18.490
She's still alive.

138
11:19.200 --> 11:19.980
That's why, after all these years,

139
11:20.030 --> 11:21.250
her life-tracking stone still glows.

140
11:41.440 --> 11:42.100
Changpu...

141
11:43.630 --> 11:44.010
You...

142
11:53.750 --> 11:54.610
Don't remember?

143
11:59.910 --> 12:01.530
You let Yan Shang

144
12:02.580 --> 12:04.340
break my legs,

145
12:05.480 --> 12:06.980
ruin my voice,

146
12:07.270 --> 12:08.460
and scar my face.

147
12:09.840 --> 12:11.770
Now that I look like this,

148
12:13.270 --> 12:14.180
you won't even acknowledge me?

149
12:14.320 --> 12:15.340
That's not true.

150
12:16.390 --> 12:16.980
It's not.

151
12:18.150 --> 12:19.130
I just didn't know

152
12:20.150 --> 12:21.250
you were still alive.

153
12:22.440 --> 12:23.130
Changpu...

154
12:24.320 --> 12:25.530
Why didn't you come find me?

155
12:27.360 --> 12:28.610
Why didn't you tell me?

156
12:29.550 --> 12:30.420
All your injuries...

157
12:31.390 --> 12:32.730
I'd have done everything I could

158
12:32.750 --> 12:33.650
to heal them.

159
12:34.440 --> 12:35.460
And Yan Shang...

160
12:36.150 --> 12:37.530
The day you fell off that cliff,

161
12:38.080 --> 12:39.460
I killed him

162
12:40.080 --> 12:41.100
to avenge you.

163
12:44.510 --> 12:45.130
So...

164
12:46.630 --> 12:47.980
You're even crazier than I am.

165
12:50.910 --> 12:52.460
You think saying all this,

166
12:53.200 --> 12:55.100
giving up your powers and status,

167
12:55.240 --> 12:56.700
and sacrificing everything to save me

168
12:58.000 --> 12:59.130
will make me forgive you?

169
13:02.790 --> 13:04.420
All the pain

170
13:05.480 --> 13:06.460
and suffering I've endured

171
13:07.960 --> 13:10.610
won't disappear just because you're sorry.

172
13:19.030 --> 13:19.770
Master.

173
13:24.480 --> 13:25.490
I've come back as a ghost

174
13:26.960 --> 13:28.250
to take my revenge.

175
14:18.750 --> 14:20.650
No!

176
14:33.550 --> 14:34.100
Master.

177
14:36.750 --> 14:37.220
Du Zhong!

178
14:38.000 --> 14:39.730
You've been practicing dark arts here?

179
14:40.000 --> 14:41.100
To fill this entire pool,

180
14:42.270 --> 14:43.300
how many innocent lives

181
14:43.600 --> 14:45.220
must have been drained of their blood?

182
14:51.790 --> 14:53.100
There's still time.

183
14:54.960 --> 14:55.770
Changpu...

184
14:56.510 --> 14:58.220
Changpu is in this pool.

185
14:59.270 --> 15:00.130
This time,

186
15:00.790 --> 15:02.610
I finally have her remains.

187
15:05.240 --> 15:07.250
I just need to kill more people,

188
15:08.150 --> 15:10.660
- and I can bring her back! - Master!

189
15:11.200 --> 15:11.700
Master.

190
15:12.000 --> 15:12.600
Let it go.

191
15:12.750 --> 15:13.700
It's all over.

192
15:13.930 --> 15:15.250
Hua Changpu is gone.

193
15:15.360 --> 15:16.530
Please stop this madness.

194
15:16.530 --> 15:17.610
You shut up!

195
15:17.870 --> 15:18.850
If he keeps this up,

196
15:19.750 --> 15:20.650
we'll have no choice but to kill him.

197
15:21.270 --> 15:21.860
No!

198
15:22.320 --> 15:23.200
Let go of me!

199
15:23.630 --> 15:24.420
Let go!

200
15:25.080 --> 15:26.220
Let me go!

201
15:27.870 --> 15:28.530
Hao.

202
15:29.680 --> 15:31.780
- Let go! - How did Master end up like this?

203
15:31.870 --> 15:32.760
Let go.

204
15:32.790 --> 15:33.730
It's over, Master.

205
15:34.560 --> 15:35.350
Hao.

206
15:39.870 --> 15:40.850
Let go!

207
15:43.780 --> 15:45.220
- Master. - Let go!

208
15:46.750 --> 15:48.580
Let me go!

209
15:52.480 --> 15:53.180
Master.

210
15:54.200 --> 15:54.770
Master.

211
15:55.870 --> 15:56.610
Let go!

212
15:58.240 --> 15:59.370
Let me go!

213
16:02.200 --> 16:02.940
Master.

214
16:03.360 --> 16:03.820
No!

215
16:09.240 --> 16:09.580
Master.

216
16:10.390 --> 16:10.890
Master.

217
16:11.750 --> 16:12.250
Master.

218
16:13.790 --> 16:14.340
Master.

219
16:17.240 --> 16:18.730
I've made a small change to the petals.

220
16:19.270 --> 16:20.180
It's a new dream.

221
16:39.670 --> 16:40.370
Master.

222
16:42.000 --> 16:43.220
Aside from immortality,

223
16:44.910 --> 16:45.740
isn't there anything else

224
16:45.740 --> 16:46.700
you want to do?

225
17:21.510 --> 17:22.090
Changpu.

226
17:24.680 --> 17:25.420
What is it

227
17:27.440 --> 17:28.530
you want out of this life?

228
17:32.510 --> 17:34.290
I don't care about attaining immortality.

229
17:36.720 --> 17:38.250
I just want to be

230
17:38.310 --> 17:38.900
with the one I love,

231
17:39.350 --> 17:40.220
free from all restraints,

232
17:40.720 --> 17:41.660
living life on our own terms.

233
17:53.510 --> 17:54.220
Master.

234
17:55.790 --> 17:56.660
I love you.

235
18:00.590 --> 18:01.940
Let's give up the Path of Detachment

236
18:03.400 --> 18:04.420
and just be together.

237
18:08.030 --> 18:08.700
Can we?

238
18:18.440 --> 18:19.050
Yes.

239
18:19.180 --> 18:22.860
♪Before seas turn to fields...♪

240
18:23.200 --> 18:24.250
I should've said yes to you

241
18:25.350 --> 18:26.140
long ago.

242
18:27.380 --> 18:29.380
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

243
18:29.620 --> 18:37.140
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

244
18:38.260 --> 18:41.980
♪When a hundred thousand blossoms have withered♪

245
18:42.260 --> 18:46.260
♪I'll still want to stay with you like this forever♪

246
18:46.540 --> 18:50.140
♪The wish we made in the long night♪

247
18:50.380 --> 18:54.460
♪Still waits to come true♪

248
19:10.310 --> 19:11.810
Qi Fengyin is absorbing the malice.

249
19:12.240 --> 19:12.940
At this rate,

250
19:13.480 --> 19:14.770
the Wanjun Lock won't be able to hold him!

251
20:14.240 --> 20:16.290
Yamao doesn't like me taking lives.

252
20:18.200 --> 20:19.810
As for those who hurt her tonight,

253
20:21.160 --> 20:22.900
I'll spare your lives for now.

254
20:23.590 --> 20:24.810
But remember this.

255
20:26.270 --> 20:27.810
The only reason you're still alive

256
20:29.030 --> 20:30.290
is because of her.

257
21:20.000 --> 21:20.860
I never thought

258
21:21.590 --> 21:22.790
I'd end up locked

259
21:22.790 --> 21:23.660
in here myself.

260
21:24.440 --> 21:26.010
Master often taught us

261
21:27.070 --> 21:28.490
not to let obsession consume us.

262
21:32.720 --> 21:33.460
But why is it...

263
21:33.680 --> 21:34.770
People like us,

264
21:36.550 --> 21:37.810
who were never

265
21:38.680 --> 21:40.220
the rebellious type,

266
21:40.830 --> 21:43.180
thought we'd found true enlightenment

267
21:45.000 --> 21:48.460
while others were caught up in worldly affairs?

268
21:53.400 --> 21:54.490
Until someone came along

269
21:57.030 --> 21:59.050
and little by little,

270
22:01.960 --> 22:03.330
made us do things for her

271
22:03.480 --> 22:04.810
we never thought we'd do.

272
22:11.440 --> 22:12.180
Hao.

273
22:13.720 --> 22:14.660
At first,

274
22:16.310 --> 22:17.250
it was nothing more

275
22:18.640 --> 22:19.700
than a second glance,

276
22:24.110 --> 22:25.330
an extra word.

277
22:27.510 --> 22:28.460
I should do the same.

278
22:30.070 --> 22:31.250
One extra step.

279
22:33.110 --> 22:33.770
As long as I hold this sword,

280
22:35.030 --> 22:36.380
no one will lay a hand on her.

281
22:38.110 --> 22:39.180
Just these

282
22:39.440 --> 22:41.050
ordinary little things.

283
22:41.960 --> 22:43.290
One part to fool others,

284
22:46.000 --> 22:48.180
nine parts to fool ourselves.

285
22:50.640 --> 22:51.900
I'll keep her safe.

286
22:53.200 --> 22:54.180
And I'll keep

287
22:55.070 --> 22:55.810
the world safe too.

288
23:02.550 --> 23:03.980
Master treats you like his own son.

289
23:04.400 --> 23:05.180
Are you really going to

290
23:05.200 --> 23:06.460
defy his orders

291
23:06.550 --> 23:07.490
for a mere herb spirit?

292
23:07.790 --> 23:08.730
He has repeatedly

293
23:09.070 --> 23:10.660
defied your orders and betrayed the sect.

294
23:11.270 --> 23:12.570
You can't have it both ways.

295
23:13.030 --> 23:14.380
You're betraying not only Mount Zhaowu

296
23:14.550 --> 23:15.860
but also all the other immortal sects!

297
23:18.350 --> 23:19.660
And before you know it, you've gone too far.

298
23:20.480 --> 23:22.380
So far that everyone says you're wrong,

299
23:23.510 --> 23:26.860
and there's no turning back.

300
23:31.550 --> 23:32.980
All for a fleeting moment of love,

301
23:33.720 --> 23:35.140
you end up losing everything.

302
23:41.510 --> 23:42.380
Consider this display

303
23:42.680 --> 23:44.460
of silver blossoms my gift.

304
23:45.070 --> 23:46.460
May your path to immortality

305
23:46.720 --> 23:47.860
be as bright as these blossoms

306
23:48.160 --> 23:49.010
and free of all obstacles.

307
23:53.790 --> 23:54.770
And I wish you

308
23:56.590 --> 23:57.420
peace and good fortune.

309
24:05.310 --> 24:06.050
Hao.

310
24:08.400 --> 24:09.250
You may go.

311
24:26.780 --> 24:33.580
♪I seem to meet you again in my dreams♪

312
24:33.860 --> 24:40.580
♪Perhaps fate had planned it all along♪

313
24:40.860 --> 24:48.060
♪Moonlight veils your loving eyes♪

314
24:48.460 --> 24:51.660
♪As if asking why you and I♪

315
24:51.740 --> 24:57.580
♪Were brought together, only to part♪

316
24:57.620 --> 25:01.420
♪Dreaming or waking, in sorrow or joy♪

317
25:01.460 --> 25:04.780
♪All I see is you♪

318
25:04.820 --> 25:12.340
♪The wind hides every feeling in my heart♪

319
25:12.740 --> 25:16.220
♪Stars or moon, flowers or snow♪

320
25:16.460 --> 25:19.620
♪All I see is you♪

321
25:19.860 --> 25:27.140
♪The wind hides every feeling in my heart♪

322
25:27.580 --> 25:31.140
♪Stars or moon, flowers or snow♪

323
25:31.180 --> 25:34.500
♪All I see is you♪

324
25:34.540 --> 25:40.860
♪No one sees the you I hold in my heart♪

325
26:01.200 --> 26:01.730
Youyou.

326
26:03.590 --> 26:04.290
Are you okay?

327
26:05.880 --> 26:07.090
I'm a mighty ancient demon.

328
26:07.160 --> 26:08.180
These little wounds are nothing.

329
26:08.790 --> 26:09.410
But you...

330
26:09.480 --> 26:10.550
It's broad daylight.

331
26:10.590 --> 26:11.900
Shouldn't a nocturnal herb like you

332
26:11.920 --> 26:12.660
be catching up on sleep?

333
26:12.750 --> 26:13.530
Why are you up?

334
26:13.790 --> 26:15.330
The immortal sects still have the talisman.

335
26:15.480 --> 26:16.570
How could I possibly sleep?

336
26:18.720 --> 26:20.460
Are you heading to Mount Zhaowu now?

337
26:20.920 --> 26:22.530
Maybe you should wait for His Lordship

338
26:22.590 --> 26:24.250
and go once he's condensed the malice.

339
26:25.880 --> 26:26.380
No.

340
26:26.830 --> 26:27.420
Yuwen Hao

341
26:27.640 --> 26:28.860
would never refuse to return the talisman.

342
26:32.830 --> 26:33.460
Listen!

343
26:35.200 --> 26:36.290
If you go now,

344
26:36.880 --> 26:38.220
he might not even see you.

345
26:38.680 --> 26:40.140
I only just heard the news.

346
26:41.000 --> 26:42.380
Yuwen Hao's master

347
26:43.640 --> 26:44.380
has died.

348
26:56.440 --> 26:59.940
The inauguration ceremony for the new leader of Mount Zhaowu

349
27:00.350 --> 27:01.730
shall now begin!

350
27:23.070 --> 27:24.180
Mount Zhaowu

351
27:25.000 --> 27:26.290
leads the Five Great Sects.

352
27:27.030 --> 27:28.380
We cannot go a day without a leader.

353
27:28.920 --> 27:29.570
I understand.

354
27:34.550 --> 27:36.860
Present the leader's sword.

355
27:47.680 --> 27:50.460
Present the leader's decree.

356
27:54.350 --> 27:55.900
The ceremony is complete!

357
28:14.960 --> 28:15.980
I, Yuwen Hao,

358
28:16.920 --> 28:17.940
following my late master's wishes,

359
28:18.720 --> 28:19.180
hereby assume

360
28:19.750 --> 28:21.980
the position of Mount Zhaowu's 19th leader.

361
28:23.160 --> 28:24.570
From this day forward, I devote myself to the immortal path.

362
28:25.480 --> 28:27.180
I'll put the people of this world first.

363
28:28.200 --> 28:28.770
Free of ego,

364
28:29.310 --> 28:29.810
free of ambition,

365
28:30.790 --> 28:31.810
free of desire and attachment.

366
28:33.200 --> 28:34.140
I'll live in harmony with all things

367
28:35.480 --> 28:37.010
and be one with the way of Heaven.

368
28:40.960 --> 28:42.420
We pay our respects, Master Yuwen!

369
29:15.350 --> 29:16.700
Will you come out on your own,

370
29:17.350 --> 29:18.190
or do I have to

371
29:18.190 --> 29:19.290
send someone to drag you out?

372
29:31.680 --> 29:33.180
I'm here to congratulate Hao

373
29:33.590 --> 29:34.460
on becoming the new leader.

374
29:34.920 --> 29:35.570
Congratulate him?

375
29:37.640 --> 29:38.900
I've never seen anyone

376
29:39.270 --> 29:41.010
so utterly shameless.

377
29:43.110 --> 29:44.900
Master should've been the one

378
29:45.790 --> 29:47.050
to preside over today's ceremony.

379
29:48.160 --> 29:49.730
But he's no longer with us.

380
29:50.680 --> 29:52.420
Hao didn't even get to see him off

381
29:53.480 --> 29:55.290
before taking over as leader.

382
29:56.200 --> 29:58.140
And it's all because of you.

383
29:59.000 --> 30:00.460
How dare you show your face here?

384
30:03.030 --> 30:03.980
If you're done talking,

385
30:04.270 --> 30:05.570
I'll go find Hao.

386
30:06.920 --> 30:08.490
So you do have a guilty conscience.

387
30:09.510 --> 30:11.140
Master and Hao

388
30:11.480 --> 30:12.770
kindly brought you to Mount Zhaowu.

389
30:13.640 --> 30:15.620
Little did they know they'd let a wolf in.

390
30:16.200 --> 30:17.010
You wicked demon.

391
30:17.680 --> 30:19.330
You didn't just fake Qi Fengyin's death.

392
30:19.830 --> 30:21.660
You secretly hid him on Mount Zhaowu.

393
30:23.720 --> 30:24.660
If I'd known how things would turn out,

394
30:25.310 --> 30:26.220
I should've

395
30:26.240 --> 30:26.900
killed you,

396
30:26.920 --> 30:28.380
you ungrateful wretch!

397
30:29.270 --> 30:30.250
Don't cultivators

398
30:30.750 --> 30:32.050
learn to watch your mouths?

399
30:32.640 --> 30:34.140
You've been through a lot lately,

400
30:34.400 --> 30:35.290
so I wasn't going to argue with you.

401
30:35.750 --> 30:36.720
But you just keep

402
30:36.720 --> 30:37.530
pushing your luck.

403
30:38.030 --> 30:39.460
Du Zhong met his end

404
30:39.790 --> 30:41.290
because his inner demons consumed him.

405
30:41.680 --> 30:42.860
What's that got to do with me?

406
30:43.270 --> 30:44.460
And you call me ungrateful?

407
30:46.000 --> 30:46.980
Remember how my master

408
30:47.310 --> 30:48.180
helped you

409
30:48.200 --> 30:48.940
defend Mount Qihuang?

410
30:50.110 --> 30:51.220
But when he became a soul crystal

411
30:51.510 --> 30:52.940
and fell into Qi Fengyin's hands,

412
30:53.440 --> 30:54.620
how did you treat him?

413
30:59.480 --> 30:59.940
Forget it.

414
31:01.400 --> 31:02.570
Enjoy running your mouth

415
31:02.830 --> 31:04.050
while you still can.

416
31:04.920 --> 31:06.250
No matter what you say,

417
31:06.960 --> 31:07.780
it won't change

418
31:07.780 --> 31:09.810
the fact that your reputation is ruined.

419
31:13.590 --> 31:14.860
Hao is at Qingjing Grove.

420
31:16.240 --> 31:17.090
You'd better make this

421
31:17.090 --> 31:18.330
the last time you bother him.

422
31:20.000 --> 31:21.010
Mount Zhaowu's reputation

423
31:21.070 --> 31:22.570
has taken a serious blow among the immortal sects.

424
31:23.070 --> 31:24.530
He has enough on his shoulders.

425
31:26.680 --> 31:27.490
He can't afford

426
31:27.550 --> 31:28.530
to be linked to you again!

427
31:32.070 --> 31:33.140
I just want the talisman back

428
31:33.140 --> 31:33.770
so I can save my master.

429
31:42.900 --> 31:47.740
[Here Lies My Master, Du Zhong]

430
32:13.160 --> 32:14.180
What happened to Mount Zhaowu today

431
32:15.960 --> 32:16.900
wasn't your fault.

432
32:18.720 --> 32:19.530
Don't blame yourself.

433
32:21.550 --> 32:22.290
At a time like this,

434
32:22.920 --> 32:24.380
I should be comforting you.

435
32:27.510 --> 32:28.660
You're here for the talisman?

436
32:34.110 --> 32:34.660
Yamao.

437
32:36.720 --> 32:37.700
You once told me

438
32:38.400 --> 32:39.620
your greatest wish

439
32:40.550 --> 32:41.940
was to save High Immortal Danshen.

440
32:43.880 --> 32:44.730
If that's true,

441
32:46.030 --> 32:47.330
why would you turn all the immortal sects

442
32:47.640 --> 32:48.900
against you for Qi Fengyin?

443
32:50.310 --> 32:50.900
How can you

444
32:52.160 --> 32:53.770
face High Immortal Danshen after this?

445
32:55.510 --> 32:56.770
I'll explain everything to Master.

446
32:57.160 --> 32:57.900
Qi Fengyin

447
32:58.310 --> 32:59.480
isn't the monster

448
32:59.480 --> 33:00.330
everyone makes him out to be.

449
33:00.990 --> 33:01.940
You spent some time with him

450
33:01.940 --> 33:03.300
in Xiangyuan Village.

451
33:03.800 --> 33:04.530
You should know

452
33:04.530 --> 33:05.360
what kind of person he really is.

453
33:06.830 --> 33:08.460
He's the source of all malice in this world.

454
33:09.440 --> 33:10.260
No matter what kind of person

455
33:10.260 --> 33:11.290
he chooses to become,

456
33:11.830 --> 33:12.570
this world

457
33:13.200 --> 33:14.220
will never accept him.

458
33:21.750 --> 33:22.660
You can have the talisman.

459
33:23.750 --> 33:24.250
But

460
33:26.270 --> 33:27.770
you must bring that girl in exchange.

461
33:28.720 --> 33:29.730
That girl?

462
33:31.640 --> 33:32.530
You mean Duyao?

463
33:35.350 --> 33:37.180
Duyao may be the spirit of Uncle Du's artifact,

464
33:38.590 --> 33:40.180
but Uncle Du has passed away.

465
33:40.510 --> 33:41.450
And she's already decided

466
33:41.450 --> 33:42.420
to follow Qi Fengyin.

467
33:42.830 --> 33:43.620
Forcing her to stay

468
33:43.620 --> 33:44.790
isn't like you.

469
33:45.110 --> 33:46.530
Besides, Mount Zhaowu is full of men.

470
33:46.920 --> 33:47.900
It wouldn't be right

471
33:47.900 --> 33:48.630
to leave her here alone.

472
33:48.680 --> 33:49.460
Whether it's right or not

473
33:51.030 --> 33:52.290
is no longer your concern.

474
33:56.070 --> 33:56.620
Yamao.

475
33:58.200 --> 33:59.180
If you want to save your master,

476
34:00.790 --> 34:02.220
you'll have to trade her for the talisman.

477
34:10.760 --> 34:11.900
Who exactly is she?

478
34:31.510 --> 34:32.420
At a time like this,

479
34:32.710 --> 34:33.780
what's there to think about?

480
34:34.320 --> 34:35.610
Would I really sacrifice

481
34:35.670 --> 34:36.490
my master

482
34:36.840 --> 34:38.420
for someone I barely know?

483
34:39.480 --> 34:40.570
But she doesn't know any better,

484
34:41.360 --> 34:42.380
and she trusts me completely.

485
34:43.110 --> 34:43.610
I know full well

486
34:43.630 --> 34:45.050
she wants to follow Qi Fengyin.

487
34:45.400 --> 34:46.770
Tricking her into going to Mount Zhaowu

488
34:47.230 --> 34:48.420
would be downright cruel.

489
34:49.150 --> 34:49.860
So what if it's cruel?

490
34:50.550 --> 34:51.980
I'm no saint to begin with.

491
34:52.630 --> 34:54.050
Besides, Yuwen Hao isn't like me.

492
34:54.510 --> 34:55.460
He's an honorable man.

493
34:56.150 --> 34:57.090
He didn't even kill me

494
34:57.110 --> 34:57.860
when he wanted my herb core.

495
34:58.320 --> 34:59.130
Why would he hurt someone

496
34:59.150 --> 35:00.460
as innocent as Duyao?

497
35:08.630 --> 35:09.170
Yamao.

498
35:12.070 --> 35:14.300
Big Brother hasn't finished condensing the malice.

499
35:16.800 --> 35:17.820
I'm not here to see him.

500
35:19.000 --> 35:19.490
Duyao.

501
35:20.190 --> 35:21.290
Let's go find some magical artifacts

502
35:21.290 --> 35:22.080
to help Qi Fengyin

503
35:22.080 --> 35:23.050
condense the malice faster.

504
35:23.050 --> 35:23.570
What do you say?

505
35:24.920 --> 35:25.420
Okay.

506
35:27.440 --> 35:28.360
I'm sorry.

507
35:28.920 --> 35:29.610
I have to do this for Master.

508
35:36.630 --> 35:38.370
Are we going to look on Mount Zhaowu?

509
35:47.840 --> 35:48.940
Why would you do that?

510
35:50.400 --> 35:51.010
I...

511
35:52.030 --> 35:52.610
I'm sorry.

512
35:53.030 --> 35:53.570
I really...

513
35:53.590 --> 35:54.820
Don't you know how dangerous it is here?

514
35:55.550 --> 35:56.570
You have no spiritual power right now.

515
35:56.710 --> 35:57.900
You need to stay behind me.

516
36:00.150 --> 36:00.650
Don't worry.

517
36:01.030 --> 36:01.980
I'll protect you.

518
36:03.840 --> 36:04.740
What kind of person am I?

519
36:05.320 --> 36:06.610
How could I trick someone so gullible?

520
36:08.400 --> 36:09.170
What did you say?

521
36:11.670 --> 36:12.460
Nothing.

522
36:12.840 --> 36:15.170
I said, come here.

523
36:15.360 --> 36:16.170
Come on, hurry back with me.

524
36:17.440 --> 36:18.820
But we haven't found

525
36:18.880 --> 36:19.780
an artifact for Big Brother yet.

526
36:20.440 --> 36:21.130
Forget the artifact.

527
36:21.360 --> 36:22.530
Bad guys always live forever, you know?

528
36:23.150 --> 36:23.740
We'd be better off

529
36:23.880 --> 36:24.740
finding something to help you

530
36:24.760 --> 36:25.210
think straight.

531
36:25.670 --> 36:25.940
Come on.

532
36:26.630 --> 36:27.010
But...

533
36:30.440 --> 36:32.210
You didn't bring the talisman back?

534
36:35.590 --> 36:36.090
Get up!

535
36:37.070 --> 36:37.980
So you just left

536
36:37.980 --> 36:39.210
the talisman with Yuwen Hao?

537
36:39.880 --> 36:41.210
That's my precious treasure!

538
36:41.320 --> 36:42.980
How could you let Mount Zhaowu keep it?

539
36:43.070 --> 36:43.690
Now I'm angry!

540
36:45.070 --> 36:46.650
So you really are after the talisman!

541
36:46.760 --> 36:47.780
- I... - Listen to me!

542
36:48.070 --> 36:49.820
I need that talisman to save my master!

543
36:49.880 --> 36:50.940
Then why didn't you bring it back?

544
36:51.000 --> 36:51.940
It's all because of Yuwen Hao!

545
36:53.920 --> 36:54.860
He said if I want the talisman,

546
36:55.480 --> 36:56.460
I have to trade Duyao for it.

547
36:58.320 --> 36:59.780
Trade Duyao?

548
37:01.110 --> 37:03.050
That doesn't sound like Yuwen Hao.

549
37:03.630 --> 37:04.900
Don't you think

550
37:04.900 --> 37:06.160
everyone on Mount Zhaowu

551
37:06.160 --> 37:07.070
turns coldhearted

552
37:07.070 --> 37:08.380
once they become the leader?

553
37:09.360 --> 37:10.490
I just think

554
37:11.000 --> 37:12.010
there might be something

555
37:12.550 --> 37:13.300
about Duyao that

556
37:13.320 --> 37:14.260
we don't know.

557
37:15.230 --> 37:16.900
Otherwise, Yuwen Hao wouldn't

558
37:16.960 --> 37:18.130
make such a heartless demand.

559
37:26.400 --> 37:27.650
I'm sure I heard something just now.

560
37:31.230 --> 37:31.860
His Lordship.

561
37:53.190 --> 37:53.780
Qi Fengyin!

562
37:53.880 --> 37:54.530
My Lord.

563
37:55.230 --> 37:56.460
What's happening to you?

564
37:59.960 --> 38:01.610
Aren't you an ancient demon?

565
38:01.710 --> 38:02.500
Shouldn't you know

566
38:02.500 --> 38:03.300
better than I do?

567
38:03.400 --> 38:03.780
He...

568
38:04.230 --> 38:04.690
I...

569
38:12.630 --> 38:13.330
Yamao!

570
38:13.510 --> 38:14.130
Are you okay?

571
38:15.150 --> 38:15.570
No.

572
38:15.880 --> 38:16.740
I can't get near him.

573
38:20.630 --> 38:21.340
Yamao?

574
38:23.800 --> 38:24.690
What's wrong with you?

575
38:25.030 --> 38:25.860
I kept calling you,

576
38:25.880 --> 38:26.610
but you didn't respond.

577
38:26.920 --> 38:27.490
My Lord.

578
38:27.880 --> 38:29.860
Why did you suddenly lose control?

579
38:30.550 --> 38:31.780
You're already a mighty devil.

580
38:32.230 --> 38:33.610
Can you still lose control of your powers?

581
38:34.320 --> 38:35.170
I don't know.

582
38:36.710 --> 38:37.940
While condensing the malice,

583
38:39.150 --> 38:40.860
too many thoughts flooded my mind.

584
38:42.070 --> 38:43.420
I couldn't focus.

585
38:45.440 --> 38:46.940
Maybe you're pushing yourself too hard.

586
38:47.630 --> 38:48.940
Why not take half a day off

587
38:48.960 --> 38:49.860
before you continue?

588
38:50.320 --> 38:51.820
We're not in a rush anyway.

589
38:56.400 --> 38:57.820
I was going to steal the talisman tonight.

590
38:58.480 --> 38:59.610
But I'll have to stay with Qi Fengyin

591
38:59.630 --> 39:00.380
until he's finished condensing the malice.

592
39:03.980 --> 39:07.220
[Strive to Cultivate Noble Virtue]

593
39:44.960 --> 39:45.610
Looking for this?

594
39:48.840 --> 39:49.690
You came for the talisman.

595
39:50.760 --> 39:51.650
Are you doing this for Yamao

596
39:52.150 --> 39:53.090
or for Qi Fengyin?

597
40:00.800 --> 40:01.740
There's no need to be nervous.

598
40:02.840 --> 40:04.090
I'm not going to stop you.

599
40:28.670 --> 40:29.940
Why did you pressure Yamao

600
40:30.400 --> 40:31.650
into trading me for the talisman?

601
40:32.280 --> 40:33.340
Do you really want to know?

602
40:34.480 --> 40:36.130
Everything my master kept from you.

603
40:37.280 --> 40:38.090
Your name,

604
40:38.630 --> 40:39.300
your identity,

605
40:40.230 --> 40:41.610
and everything you've ever wanted.

606
40:42.630 --> 40:43.780
Whenever you're ready to know,

607
40:44.190 --> 40:45.460
come find me at Mount Zhaowu.

608
40:49.190 --> 40:50.050
I'll tell you everything.

609
41:03.590 --> 41:04.170
Master Yuwen.

610
41:04.710 --> 41:06.050
You're just letting her take the talisman?

611
41:06.840 --> 41:08.420
She came for it alone.

612
41:09.630 --> 41:10.290
That means Yamao

613
41:10.290 --> 41:11.380
has already made her choice.

614
41:11.510 --> 41:13.040
She won't trade Duyao for it.

615
41:14.280 --> 41:15.010
If this goes on,

616
41:15.510 --> 41:17.260
High Immortal Danshen's life will be at risk.

617
41:18.630 --> 41:19.490
I might as well let her have it.

618
41:20.320 --> 41:21.050
I don't understand.

619
41:22.110 --> 41:23.380
Why do you and Master

620
41:23.800 --> 41:25.050
both want to bring her here?

621
41:26.840 --> 41:27.780
Do you know who she is?

622
41:46.070 --> 41:46.940
Duyao's missing!

623
41:47.710 --> 41:48.650
I told her today

624
41:48.920 --> 41:50.940
that Mount Zhaowu has magical artifacts

625
41:51.000 --> 41:52.090
that could help Qi Fengyin condense the malice faster.

626
41:53.120 --> 41:53.960
She didn't go

627
41:53.960 --> 41:54.980
to Mount Zhaowu alone, did she?

628
41:54.980 --> 41:55.780
Oh, Yamao!

629
41:56.160 --> 41:57.820
She follows you and His Lordship everywhere.

630
41:58.070 --> 41:58.740
Of course she believes

631
41:58.740 --> 41:59.570
everything you two say.

632
42:00.130 --> 42:01.650
You shouldn't have gone soft on her.

633
42:01.960 --> 42:02.940
Now you have no talisman,

634
42:03.070 --> 42:03.940
and you've lost her too.

635
42:04.030 --> 42:05.050
You've ended up with nothing.

636
42:06.670 --> 42:07.820
Stay here and watch Qi Fengyin.

637
42:07.880 --> 42:08.740
I'll go to Mount Zhaowu.

638
42:10.880 --> 42:11.530
Qi Fengyin.

639
42:15.400 --> 42:16.090
Qi Fengyin!

640
42:43.400 --> 42:45.140
If he keeps causing such a commotion,

641
42:45.360 --> 42:46.580
the immortal sects will find us.

642
42:46.800 --> 42:48.090
I know how to calm him down.

643
43:12.230 --> 43:13.860
My Lord, wake up!

644
43:14.030 --> 43:15.200
It's Yamao!

645
43:15.670 --> 43:17.540
She's the woman you love most!

646
44:05.000 --> 44:06.130
I can take responsibility for you, too.

647
44:06.670 --> 44:09.090
We can get married and become husband and wife.

648
44:09.280 --> 44:11.010
Even after the mystical flower hatches,

649
44:11.190 --> 44:12.410
I won't want to let you go.

650
44:12.920 --> 44:14.550
But once she touches the shrine,

651
44:14.800 --> 44:16.050
its memories and powers

652
44:16.070 --> 44:17.440
will return to her body.

653
44:17.550 --> 44:19.260
The only reason I awakened

654
44:19.440 --> 44:21.460
was to kill Qi Fengyin.

655
44:41.380 --> 44:45.420
♪See this world where flowers have yet to bloom♪

656
44:45.660 --> 44:49.100
♪So many longings♪

657
44:49.780 --> 44:51.860
♪Linger in the web of fate♪

658
44:52.060 --> 44:57.060
♪Then vanish like mist in a moment♪

659
44:57.980 --> 45:02.020
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

660
45:02.260 --> 45:05.700
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

661
45:06.380 --> 45:08.460
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

662
45:08.660 --> 45:16.060
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

663
45:17.460 --> 45:21.140
♪When a hundred thousand blossoms have withered♪

664
45:21.380 --> 45:25.060
♪I'll still want to stay with you like this forever♪

665
45:25.700 --> 45:29.260
♪The wish we made in the long night♪

666
45:29.580 --> 45:33.740
♪Still waits to come true♪

667
45:33.980 --> 45:37.660
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

668
45:38.220 --> 45:41.860
♪I'll stay by your side♪

